# Momentum Scanner design system

Spec: `docs/design-system/` (`DESIGN.light.md`, `DESIGN.dark.md`, `tokens.json`, `README.md` = token → usage table).

## Theming

- Light/dark is applied **only** by the two ThemeProviders:
  - shell `web-app/spog/src/providers/ThemeProvider/ThemeProvider.tsx` (`applyTheme(document.documentElement, …)`)
  - MFEs `web-app/shared-components/src/ui/providers/ThemeProvider/ThemeProvider.tsx`
- Colours/fonts come from `shared-components/src/theme/tokens.json` via `tokens.ts`. Never hard-code hex colours, add `[data-theme]` blocks, or use `prefers-color-scheme` elsewhere.
- Token change: update `docs/design-system/tokens.json`, copy to `shared-components/src/theme/tokens.json` (a test enforces equality).

## Using tokens

```css
/* ❌ */ .card { background: #1c2026; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; }
/* ✅ */ .card { background: var(--color-surface-container); color: var(--color-on-surface); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
```

- Stitch colours: `var(--color-<token>)` (`surface-container-high`, `on-surface-variant`, `primary-container`, …).
- Elevation: page `surface` → header/sidebar/rows `surface-container-low` → cards `surface-container` → hover/dialogs `surface-container-high` → menus/popovers `surface-container-highest`.
- Hover = state layer: `color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary), var(--color-on-primary) 8%)`.
- Fonts: `--font-family` (body), `--font-family-headline`, `--font-family-label` (JetBrains Mono for tickers/prices).
- Spacing/radius/sizes: `--space-*`, `--radius-*` (4px base), `--font-size-*` from `theme.css`.

## Widgets

- Every widget/card (titled panel: table section, facts grid, chart, breakdown) is a `CollapsibleCard` from `@trading-agent/shared-components`: header toggles collapse; badges/controls go in `meta` (outside the toggle); set a stable `persistKey` (`<mfe>.<page>.<widget>`). No one-off collapsibles. Details: `.cursor/agents/ui-developer.md` § Widgets are collapsible.

## Hard rules

- Green/red **only** for price movement deltas, via `--color-price-up` / `--color-price-down` — never in chrome. Telemetry uses `secondary`, alerts use `error`.
- Price charts: **Lightweight Charts** (TradingView, Apache-2.0) — colours read from the CSS variables at runtime; don't add another charting library. See `docs/design-system/README.md` § Charts.
- Disclaimer pill "Screener — not a forecast": `tertiary-container` / `on-tertiary-container`, persistent on every screen.
